---
// Services Page - Kanbir Solutions
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Kanbir Solutions Services: accounting, tax, ERP integration, business advisory and R&D claims for ambitious businesses." />
  <title>Services | Kanbir Solutions</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7fbff;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-soft: #f3f8ff;
      --text: #10243b;
      --muted: #5f718d;
      --accent: #1f6eed;
      --accent-light: #60a5fa;
      --accent-soft: #dbeefe;
      --border: rgba(31,110,237,0.12);
      --shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(31,110,237,0.12);
      --radius: 28px;
      --transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(96,165,250,0.18), transparent 25%), radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(59,130,246,0.08), transparent 20%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .navbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      width: 100%;
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.1);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .navbar.sticky { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.98); padding: 10px 0; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(2,6,23,0.06); }

    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .nav-logo {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .nav-logo span {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-light));
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(31,110,237,0.18);
    }

    .nav-logo img { height:84px; width:auto; transition: transform 0.28s ease, filter 0.28s ease; }
    .nav-logo img:hover { transform: scale(1.06); filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 30px rgba(31,110,237,0.12)); }
    .nav-links a { position: relative; }
    .nav-links a::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left:50%; transform: translateX(-50%) scaleX(0); bottom: -6px; width: 56%; height: 3px; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-light)); transition: transform 0.28s ease; }
    .nav-links a:hover::after { transform: translateX(-50%) scaleX(1); }
    .sr-only { position: absolute !important; height: 1px; width: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(1px,1px,1px,1px); white-space: nowrap; }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      background: rgba(96,165,250,0.12);
    }

    .nav-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn {
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-light));
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(31,110,237,0.18);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(31,110,237,0.06);
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.18);
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .hero {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 120px 32px 64px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(360px, 0.9fr);
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(96,165,250,0.12);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      content: '✓';
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(31,110,237,0.16);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 5vw, 5.2rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
      max-width: 640px;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero h1 strong {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 620px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .hero-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(31,110,237,0.1);
    }

    .hero-card h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      display: grid;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .hero-visual > div {
      border-radius: 32px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(31,110,237,0.14);
    }

    .hero-visual img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .hero-visual .visual-panel {
      padding: 28px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(31,110,237,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.4));
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    }

    .hero-visual .visual-panel h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .hero-visual .visual-panel p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .section {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 32px;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .section-head span {
      display: inline-flex;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.8rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .section-head p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 720px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .service-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 32px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(31,110,237,0.1);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .service-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 42px 90px rgba(31,110,237,0.16);
    }

    .service-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 18px;
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-light));
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .service-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .service-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .service-card .link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 88px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: var(--surface-soft);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.1);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 28px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    }

    .stat-card h3 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .stat-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .process {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 88px;
    }

    .process-step {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.08);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 55px rgba(31,110,237,0.08);
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .process-step span {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(31,110,237,0.1);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .process-step h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .process-step p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .footer-cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(31,110,237,0.12), rgba(96,165,250,0.08));
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,110,237,0.14);
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 52px 48px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3.2rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .footer-cta p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .footer-cta .footer-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .mouse-follower,
    .mouse-glow {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9999;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
    }

    .mouse-follower.active,
    .mouse-glow.active { opacity: 1; }

    .mouse-follower {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(31,110,237,0.95), rgba(96,165,250,0.85));
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(31,110,237,0.35);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .mouse-glow {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(31,110,237,0.16), transparent 55%);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .process { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .footer-cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .nav-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: 20px; }
      .nav-links { justify-content: flex-start; }
      .hero { padding: 80px 24px 40px; }
      .section { padding: 0 24px; }
      .services-grid, .stats-grid, .process { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-cta { padding: 36px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a class="nav-logo" href="/" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="Kanbir Solutions" style="height:84px; width:auto; display:block;" />
        <span class="sr-only">Kanbir Solutions</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-secondary">Client Portal</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary">Book a Call</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Trusted by ambitious businesses across the UK</span>
        <h1>Strategy-led finance, bookkeeping and advisory services built to grow your business.</h1>
        <p>Kanbir Solutions helps scaleups and high-growth firms simplify accounting, unlock tax savings, integrate ERP systems and claim R&D relief with confidence.</p>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-card">
            <h3>Accounting built for growth</h3>
            <p>Cloud-native bookkeeping, management reporting and KPI dashboards that keep leaders aligned.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-card">
            <h3>Tax and compliance clarity</h3>
            <p>End-to-end tax planning, VAT support and HMRC compliance with proactive advice.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-card">
            <h3>ERP adoption without friction</h3>
            <p>Practical systems integration to unify sales, finance and operations across your business.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-card">
            <h3>Data-driven business advisory</h3>
            <p>Financial modelling, cash flow planning and strategic guidance for the next stage of growth.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;">
          <button class="btn btn-primary">See Our Services</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary">Request a Proposal</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div>
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Finance team planning" />
        </div>
        <div class="visual-panel">
          <h3>Fast-moving teams choose Kanbir</h3>
          <p>We support ambitious founders with precise financial planning, tax optimisation and systems that keep growth sustainable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span>What we do</span>
        <h2>Services designed around your business lifecycle</h2>
        <p>From startup finance to international expansion, we combine expert accounting, tax, ERP and advisory services for every stage of your journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">📘</div>
          <h3>Accounting & bookkeeping</h3>
          <p>Real-time ledger management, cashflow reporting and month-end close that keeps your numbers accurate and understandable.</p>
          <a class="link" href="#">Learn more</a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">🧾</div>
          <h3>Tax planning & compliance</h3>
          <p>Corporate tax, VAT, payroll and R&D claims support to turn compliance into a growth asset.</p>
          <a class="link" href="#">Learn more</a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">⚙️</div>
          <h3>ERP integration</h3>
          <p>Systems implementation that removes manual work and gives finance leaders a single source of truth.</p>
          <a class="link" href="#">Learn more</a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">📈</div>
          <h3>Business advisory</h3>
          <p>Operational planning, margin improvement and growth modelling to help you make smarter decisions.</p>
          <a class="link" href="#">Learn more</a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">🔬</div>
          <h3>R&D claims</h3>
          <p>Claims preparation and tax relief strategy for innovative businesses investing in product development.</p>
          <a class="link" href="#">Learn more</a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">🌍</div>
          <h3>International finance</h3>
          <p>Multi-jurisdictional support for UK companies operating overseas and overseas businesses entering the UK market.</p>
          <a class="link" href="#">Learn more</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" style="padding-bottom: 120px;">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span>Why Kanbir</span>
        <h2>Focus on growth, not process</h2>
        <p>We bring the clarity, structure and systems that let leadership focus on customers while finance runs smoothly behind the scenes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>500+</h3>
          <p>Businesses supported across manufacturing, tech, retail and professional services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>15+</h3>
          <p>Years of combined experience in UK accounting, taxation and ERP transformation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>£18m+</h3>
          <p>R&D tax relief recovered for clients across ambitious scaleups and established enterprises.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>24/7</h3>
          <p>Support through fast-moving financial deadlines and growth cycles, backed by responsive advisory teams.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="process">
        <article class="process-step">
          <span>1</span>
          <h3>Discovery</h3>
          <p>We map your existing finance, tax and systems landscape to identify what matters most.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step">
          <span>2</span>
          <h3>Blueprint</h3>
          <p>We create a tailored plan combining accounting, compliance, ERP and advisory workstreams.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step">
          <span>3</span>
          <h3>Implementation</h3>
          <p>We execute with minimal disruption, integrating systems and strengthening your finance operations.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step">
          <span>4</span>
          <h3>Growth support</h3>
          <p>We stay close with monthly reports, tax planning cycles and strategic advisory sessions.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="footer-cta">
        <div>
          <h2>Ready to get financial clarity for your business?</h2>
          <p>Start with a free consultation and see how Kanbir Solutions can simplify accounting, reduce tax risk, and support growth.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-buttons">
          <button class="btn btn-primary">Book a consultation</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary">Download service brief</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="mouse-follower"></div>
  <div class="mouse-glow"></div>

  <script>
    const follower = document.querySelector('.mouse-follower');
    const glow = document.querySelector('.mouse-glow');
    document.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {
      follower.classList.add('active');
      glow.classList.add('active');
      follower.style.left = e.clientX + 'px';
      follower.style.top = e.clientY + 'px';
      glow.style.left = e.clientX + 'px';
      glow.style.top = e.clientY + 'px';
    });
    document.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
      follower.classList.remove('active');
      glow.classList.remove('active');
    });
    const nav = document.querySelector('.navbar');
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      nav.classList.toggle('sticky', window.scrollY > 20);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
